215
00:08:25,628 --> 00:08:26,668
Bakın Adnan Menderes,

216
00:08:26,748 --> 00:08:27,448
Refik Koraltan,

217
00:08:27,528 --> 00:08:28,368
Fuat Köprülü

218
00:08:28,368 --> 00:08:29,828
