227
00:08:38,008 --> 00:08:38,968
Ki Celal Bayar

228
00:08:38,968 --> 00:08:40,087
Kurtuluş Savaşı'nda

229
00:08:40,927 --> 00:08:41,768
eski

230
00:08:41,768 --> 00:08:42,587
